{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"きたーーー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ついにーーー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"京都全国握手会"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっきゅん先輩とペアでーす。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よし、よし、明日は私のありったけの萌え力で皆さんをキュンキュンさせちゃうぞお＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼(^o^)／......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以前、乃木どこでずっきゅん先輩が私に握手会の極意を教えていただきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なかなかキュンとする言葉などどうしても恥ずかしくて出来ないのです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、明日は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"う、うん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ガンバルヨ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/12/28/5722637/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん、お手柔らかにぃ～❤❤❤笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クリスマスは、親友の奈央と過ごしました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/12/28/5722637/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱりあんたと一緒が一番落ち着くよ。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/12/28/5722637/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"奈央とのおしゃべりは本当に楽しいの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以前アイドリングさんのライブを観にいったときも奈央のおしゃべりは本当に観てて愉快な気持ちになる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同じアイドルとして刺激うけるかぎりですｖ（＾＿＾ｖ）♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来年も変わらずよろしくね！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/12/28/5722637/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゅんなとばいばい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゅん！じゅん！"}],"source":"archive"}